// ─── computeLayout ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/**
 * Derives a stable { x, y } position for every node in the tree.
 *
 * Algorithm:
 *   1. Walk nodes in order of increasing depth (BFS ordering is implicit
 *      because nodes are always appended after their parent).
